msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Excuse me! Have either of you seen a tall, skinny man\r\n"
"with glasses around here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "No, I haven't. What's going on? Why the big fuss?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"One of my subordinates left a message on my cell, saying\r\n"
"he was going to jump off the Millennium Tower and kill\r\n"
"himself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"But sir, Akimoto just came back from a vacation with his\r\n"
"fiancée. Shouldn't he be on cloud nine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"This is Akimoto we're talking about. You know how\r\n"
"unpredictable he can be. I swear, that man's caused me\r\n"
"more trouble than anyone I know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Hey, Uncle Kaz. Do you think this Akimoto-san is the same\r\n"
"one we know...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "I really hope it isn't, but you're probably right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Should we go check it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"I don't think we can. Only authorized personnel can enter\r\n"
"the Millennium Tower..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Uncle Kaz... What should we do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Please help Akimoto! I've got no one else to turn to!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Uncle Kaz... What should we do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "I'm sure he's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Mmm, I dunno..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Let's go check it out."
msgstr ""

